{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Meu8B5nEdRCWJk8x8gz5V8","type":"tool_result","content":"### rowOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction rowOf(n: number, step: Vec3, part: Each<[i: number]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies, copy `i` offset by `i × step`.\n\n### around()\n\n```ts\nfunction around(n: number, part: Each<[i: number]>, o: { r?: number; phase?: number } = {}): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies turned about Y, `360 / n` degrees apart from `phase`. `r` first pushes each copy\nout along its own +Z; with the default 0 the part's own `at` places it.\n\n### gridOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction gridOf(nx: number, nz: number, step: number | readonly [number, number], part: Each<[ix: number, iz: number]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`nx × nz` copies on the floor plane, copy (ix, iz) offset by `(ix × sx, 0, iz × sz)`.\n\nrowOf => function m0(e,t,n){let r=[];for(let i=0;i<e;i++)r.push({at:[t[0]*i,t[1]*i,t[2]*i],group:[f0(n,i)]});return r}\naround => function p0(e,t,n={}){let r=[];for(let i=0;i<e;i++){let a=f0(t,i),o=[0,(n.phase??0)+360*i/e,0];r.push({rot:o,group:[n.r?{at:[0,0,n.r],group:[a]}:a]})}return r}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"0cf574c7-b6d6-4d69-b4f2-2b23274d98cd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:35:17.206Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### rowOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction rowOf(n: number, step: Vec3, part: Each<[i: number]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies, copy `i` offset by `i × step`.\n\n### around()\n\n```ts\nfunction around(n: number, part: Each<[i: number]>, o: { r?: number; phase?: number } = {}): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies turned about Y, `360 / n` degrees apart from `phase`. `r` first pushes each copy\nout along its own +Z; with the default 0 the part's own `at` places it.\n\n### gridOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction gridOf(nx: number, nz: number, step: number | readonly [number, number], part: Each<[ix: number, iz: number]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`nx × nz` copies on the floor plane, copy (ix, iz) offset by `(ix × sx, 0, iz × sz)`.\n\nrowOf => function m0(e,t,n){let r=[];for(let i=0;i<e;i++)r.push({at:[t[0]*i,t[1]*i,t[2]*i],group:[f0(n,i)]});return r}\naround => function p0(e,t,n={}){let r=[];for(let i=0;i<e;i++){let a=f0(t,i),o=[0,(n.phase??0)+360*i/e,0];r.push({rot:o,group:[n.r?{at:[0,0,n.r],group:[a]}:a]})}return r}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Meu8B5nEdRCWJk8x8gz5V8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
