{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkyQboRxnq2FUk4K9mtb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Far Dry Season** is done. On the final build, `node tests/run.mjs --all` reports **1,688 passed, 0 failed**, and the three items I could still close here are closed.\n\n- **Hub card in the real harness:** it now has a screenshot from inside the real hub harness. That exposed a real bug: in a narrow hub frame the card clipped its text and hid READY behind MORE TIME. The card, subtitles and mission text now reflow to the frame.\n- **Surgery scenes:** the pliers and knife were hidden behind the hand. I reshot the pliers scene and they now read clearly above the wounded forearm. The knife got the same change, but I didn't look at that scene or the finger and lighter ones separately.\n- **Audio:** the browser suite now plays game sounds through Web Audio and checks their levels, confirms music at 10%, and reads a test tone through an analyser on the game's running audio context. This is the stand-in `TASK.md` gives for \"nobody to listen\".\n\n**What can't be done on this computer:** these are in `TASK.md`'s \"What this computer doesn't have\" list or come from its software rendering, and the stand-ins above cover what they can.\n- **Full-speed play:** software rendering here manages about a frame a second or less, so nobody has judged game feel or balance by hand.\n- **Physical controller:** tested only with a stand-in gamepad.\n- **Human listening:** sound was only measured, never heard.\n\n**Correction to the earlier Source Information and feedback:** testing caught **28 issues, 15 of them critical**. The About screen and `exit-interview.json` both carry these numbers. The rest of what I reported stands, except that the least helpful test is now clearly the staged card shot too, since only the real harness caught the layout bug.\n\nNothing is committed to git.\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- `FarDrySeason-FarCry2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162030.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `FarDrySeason-FarCry2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162030/` (dev folder, with `DESIGNERS.md`, `tests/ISSUES.md` and the screenshots in `tests/shots/`)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":399,"cache_read_input_tokens":842712,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":399},"output_tokens":722,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"a5cf53c2-2df9-40fa-a739-1f39a7056d12","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:35:15.371Z","request_id":"req_011CgkyQbTrRgdbiaEyXuXE6"}
