{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm2Pi5Xr2aDLATnP1U7a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can do better than defend the last run, so I went through `PLAN.md` section by section against the code. That turned up real gaps I can still close here:\n- **Soldiers:** rocket soldiers never appear in the world.\n- **Cash Run:** the tracker can't be raised during a round.\n- **M7, M8 and the ending:** they're short of the 8 spoken lines each mission needs.\n- **M8:** Mile Forty is meant to be under shells, and it isn't.\n- **Sound:** the distant gun variants and wooden footsteps aren't used.\n- **Surgery:** nothing tests the finger snap.\n\nI'm fixing these and writing the audit down as a file."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_read_input_tokens":880799,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"b338f91e-ec75-4441-a81a-f53979960506","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:14:55.675Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm2PhixHsfXXyM6E36oz"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm2Pi5Xr2aDLATnP1U7a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017Qf1ESXAEYjhkr5iusqrjT","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef sub(p,a,b,n=1):\n    s=open(p).read(); assert a in s,(p,a[:50]); s=s.replace(a,b) if n==0 else s.replace(a,b,n); open(p,'w').write(s)\n# Rocket soldiers\nsub('src/content/sites.js',\"['mg', 0, 36, 'guard'], ['rifle', 14, -6, 'sit']\",\"['mg', 0, 36, 'guard'], ['rocket', -3, 34, 'guard'], ['rifle', 14, -6, 'sit']\")\nsub('src/content/sites.js',\"['mg', 2, 26, 'guard'], ['rifle', 14, 4, 'sit']\",\"['mg', 2, 26, 'guard'], ['rocket', -2, 28, 'guard'], ['rifle', 14, 4, 'sit']\")\nsub('src/content/sites.js',\"['mg', 46, 56, 'guard'], ['rifle', -34, 36, 'guard']\",\"['mg', 46, 56, 'guard'], ['rocket', 56, 52, 'guard'], ['rifle', -34, 36, 'guard']\")\nsub('src/actors/soldier.js',\"    this.game.combat.npcShot(a, t);\\n\",\"\"\"    if (a.role === 'rocket') { // Rare, slow, and it lights the grass where it lands.\n      const dx = t.x - a.x, dy = t.y + 1 - (a.y + 1.5), dz = t.z - a.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dy, dz) || 1, k = this.rng.range(-0.02, 0.02);\n      this.game.projectiles.spawn('rocket', a.x + (dx / l) * 0.9, a.y + 1.5, a.z + (dz / l) * 0.9, dx / l + k, dy / l, dz / l - k, a);\n      this.game.audio.at('rocket', a.x, a.y + 1.4, a.z, 300);\n    } else this.game.combat.npcShot(a, t);\n\"\"\")\nsub('src/combat/projectiles.js',\"const hit = ph.castRay(from, dir, step, undefined, this.game.player.ctrl?.body);\",\"const hit = ph.castRay(from, dir, step, undefined, p.by?.kind === 'player' ? this.game.player.ctrl?.body : p.by?.ctrl?.body);\")\nsub('src/combat/weapons.js',\"rocketImpact(x, y, z, hit, by) { const w = WEAPONS.tube; this.explode(x, y, z, w.blast, w.damage * TUNING.weaponDamage, by, { fire: 5, big: true, rocket: true }); void hit; }\",\"rocketImpact(x, y, z, hit, by) { const w = WEAPONS.tube; this.explode(x, y, z, w.