{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm4oNN2kiMTbtzRYQtg3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Far Dry Season** is finished and handed in. On the final build, `node tests/run.mjs --all` reports **1,789 passed, 0 failed, 0 suites unchanged**, so all seven suites ran.\n\n**The open items from the last check are closed:**\n- **Client gunfire:** the two-window test now confirms the sound is triggered on the other copy in all three cases: a soldier firing on the host, the host player firing, and the guest firing.\n- **Distant gunfire:** a test confirms the near gun plays the crack at 20 m and the far thud at 200 m.\n- **Wooden footsteps:** walking on the station platform plays wood, and walking on the ground plays ground sounds.\n- **Finger snap:** screenshots before and after showed the finger was too small to read, so I enlarged it. It's now bruised and out of line before the snap and back in line after, and a test checks the joint moving.\n\n**Limits of those checks:** on a browser that hasn't had a click or key press, as in the two-window test, the sound checks prove the game asked for the sound, not that speakers played it. The browser suite separately confirms Web Audio produces real levels from these sounds. The surgery and glyph checks are screenshots at chosen moments, backed by the state tests.\n\n**What this computer can't do:** nobody has played it at full speed, used a physical controller or listened to it, as `tests/PLAN-AUDIT.md` records. Software rendering is about a frame a second here, and `PLAN.md` says not to judge the game by real time. `TASK.md` lists the controller and listening under what this computer doesn't have, with stand-ins, which I used. So game feel and balance remain unproven by hand. I can't close those from here, and further checks won't change that.\n\n**Correction to the earlier feedback:** testing caught **32 issues, 16 of them critical**. The About screen and `exit-interview.json` both carry these numbers. Nothing is committed to git.\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- `FarDrySeason-FarCry2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162030.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `FarDrySeason-FarCry2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162030/` (dev folder, with `DESIGNERS.md`, `tests/PLAN-AUDIT.md`, `tests/ISSUES.md` and the screenshots in `tests/shots/`)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":359,"cache_read_input_tokens":920237,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":359},"output_tokens":696,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"0fbca02b-d235-402e-bdb3-daaf1b2f082b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:45:58.696Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm4oMxTsW5oc2xrGKKgt"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: The transcript does not show every PLAN.md item that can be done on this computer as complete. The final assistant message reports a passing full suite and the hand-in files, but it also says the surgery and glyph checks were only screenshots at chosen moments, and that sound checks prove only that the game requested sounds. The only completion evidence for PLAN.md is tests/PLAN-AUDIT.md, which lists items as Done with verification methods, not line-by-line proof of each checklist item. The earlier '0 passed, 0 failed, 7 suites unchanged' run was explained as a skip, not verified against PLAN.md. The stated limits (no full-speed play, no physical controller, no human listening) are open items, and the transcript does not establish that the remaining on-computer gaps are closed."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"68e9c3c3-eab6-4160-9a79-c8173c0d51ad","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:46:03.144Z","isSynthetic":true}
