/*.js src/vehicles/*.js | cut -c1-200 | head -30; grep -n -E \"rescue|getUp|hp = |\\.hp=|60|40\" src/actors/buddy.js | cut -c1-200 | head -40; grep -n -E \"rescue|damagePlayer|playerDown|goDownPlayer\" src/game.js | cut -c1-200 | head -30","description":"Find plan values and code for the four failures"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mit1j9pr3Pp8Q3xtchzvzy","type":"tool_result","content":"71:- **Mags Oyelaran:** struck-off army medic; talks while she works on you.\n186:**Movement.** `CharacterController` stays grounded on the heightfield and is right for a grounded soldier. `PlatformerCharacter` (triple jumps, ground pounds) is not. `speed` is set in the constructor and read as a plain field; `setInpu\n347:- Strong wind (above 6 m/s) gives an ember jump: small chance to light a fuel cell 2 to 3 cells downwind, which is how fire crosses a road.\n404:| Walk (stick partly tilted; Caps Lock toggles it on keyboard, never Alt, since Alt+D jumps to the address bar) | 3.6 | Quiet |\n406:| Sprint (click L3 or hold Shift while moving forward) | 7.4 | 6 s of stamina, 8 s to refill, heard at 40 m, can't fire or aim |\n410:Jump: `jumpSpeed` 8 (about 1.3 m with gravity -24), enough for low walls. Fall damage above 6 m. No prone, no ladders, no ledge grabs.\n434:| `mg` | Mounted MG | technical | no ammo; overheats at 6 s, cools in 4 s | 10/s | 20 | 180 m | - | - | |\n445:- **Thresholds shown on the gun itself, with no number on the HUD:** at 60 and above it's clean; 30 to 59 rust parts appear (extra named parts toggled visible, red/plum on the barrel and receiver); below 30 tape and a smoke puff on firi\n455:- **Syrette:** L1/Q, hold 0.8 s, +40 HP. Carry 3 (upgrade to 5). The animation: thigh jab, thumb.\n456:- **Field surgery:** below 20 HP the screen drains colour and a heartbeat starts. Pressing Heal runs one of four scenes (about 4 s, can't move or shoot, can be interrupted by another hit), and leaves you at 40 HP with no item used.\n526:| | Ines Carvalho | Dov Halpern | Mags Oyelaran |\n536:**Rescue.** At HP 0 with a buddy available: the screen drops, and you are dragged backward in first person (low camera, sky, their boots, their gunfire) while they swear at you; then you are up at 40 HP (Mags 60) with them next to you, \n614:| M5 | The Water Question (Vance) | 7 min | Destroy the pump on the Mercy, because Three Wells \"feeds the Harvest\" | Charges, defending, moral cost | Mags: first open the bypass and hold the pump house for 60 s, so the cistern fills | W\n627:**Attract, tests and dev mode** can jump to any mission start: each mission has a `setup` that puts the world in the right state (`world.reset`, story flags, scars, buddies, loadout), so `dev.startMission('m6')` is one call.\n635:Each mission gets 8 to 15 spoken lines in this voice. Each character has a tic: **Vance** invoices (*conclude, regrettable, the matter of*). **Ansa** corrects grammar. **Odile** counts things. **Tibor** talks about returns. **Bakr** tel\n648:- **Mags:** *Hold still. No, you can't feel that. No, that's normal. Hold still.* / *Not today. Today you owe me money.*\n689:| Jump | Cross | A | Space |\n885:- **People:** soldier (Concord, Harvest; 3 hat variants, 4 `skin` values), mercs (Ines, Dov, Mags, a silhouette each), Odile (veil, cigarette), Tibor (apron), Vance (peaked cap, medals), Ansa (headscarf, spectacles), Harrow (blanket, wi\n1069:6. M5 (Mags offers her alternate plan in M6 instead: get the field workers out first, for less pay).\n/bin/bash: line 1: cd: too many arguments\nugrep: warning: src/actors/player.js: No such file or directory\nugrep: warning: src/content/tuning-defaults.js: No such file or directory\nugrep: warning: src/combat/*.js: No such file or directory\nugrep: warning: src/vehicles/*.js: No such file or directory\nugrep: warning: src/actors/buddy.js: No such file or directory\nugrep: warning: src/game.js: No such file or directory","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"6e8fe5a6-8774-488a-a8ba-e98615d2a774","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:45:37.996Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"71:- **Mags Oyelaran:** struck-off army medic; talks while she works on you.\n186:**Movement.** `CharacterController` stays grounded on the heightfield and is right for a grounded soldier. `PlatformerCharacter` (triple jumps, ground pounds) is not. `speed` is set in the constructor and read as a plain field; `setInpu\n347:- Strong wind (above 6 m/s) gives an ember jump: small chance to light a fuel cell 2 to 3 cells downwind, which is how fire crosses a road.\n404:| Walk (stick partly tilted; Caps Lock toggles it on keyboard, never Alt, since Alt+D jumps to the address bar) | 3.6 | Quiet |\n406:| Sprint (click L3 or hold Shift while moving forward) | 7.4 | 6 s of stamina, 8 s to refill, heard at 40 m, can't fire or aim |\n410:Jump: `jumpSpeed` 8 (about 1.3 m with gravity -24), enough for low walls. Fall damage above 6 m. No prone, no ladders, no ledge grabs.\n434:| `mg` | Mounted MG | technical | no ammo; overheats at 6 s, cools in 4 s | 10/s | 20 | 180 m | - | - | |\n445:- **Thresholds shown on the gun itself, with no number on the HUD:** at 60 and above it's clean; 30 to 59 rust parts appear (extra named parts toggled visible, red/plum on the barrel and receiver); below 30 tape and a smoke puff on firi\n455:- **Syrette:** L1/Q, hold 0.8 s, +40 HP. Carry 3 (upgrade to 5). The animation: thigh jab, thumb.\n456:- **Field surgery:** below 20 HP the screen drains colour and a heartbeat starts. Pressing Heal runs one of four scenes (about 4 s, can't move or shoot, can be interrupted by another hit), and leaves you at 40 HP with no item used.\n526:| | Ines Carvalho | Dov Halpern | Mags Oyelaran |\n536:**Rescue.** At HP 0 with a buddy available: the screen drops, and you are dragged backward in first person (low camera, sky, their boots, their gunfire) while they swear at you; then you are up at 40 HP (Mags 60) with them next to you, \n614:| M5 | The Water Question (Vance) | 7 min | Destroy the pump on the Mercy, because Three Wells \"feeds the Harvest\" | Charges, defending, moral cost | Mags: first open the bypass and hold the pump house for 60 s, so the cistern fills | W\n627:**Attract, tests and dev mode** can