{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm9TLCKWJaZakqomKm5j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H871viRcr6fGUngrvQdKcf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm tests/tmp-mg.mjs\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/combat/weapons.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=\"    this.fireTimer = 1 / w.rate;\"; assert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,\"    this.fireTimer = Math.max(this.fireTimer, -dt) + 1 / w.rate; // Keep the leftover, so the rate is the table's and not rounded up to whole frames.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='tests/ISSUES.md'; s=open(p).read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- The mounted MG could never overheat: its barrel cooled faster than firing heated it, even with the trigger held (requirement-by-requirement suite). Not critical, but a plan mechanic that did not exist.\n- A tapped jump rose 0.68 m instead of the plan's 1.3 m, because releasing the button cut it short, so low walls needed a held jump (requirement-by-requirement suite). Not critical.\n- Automatic guns fired slower than the weapon table: the fire timer rounded up to whole frames, 8.6 shots a second for the MG's 10 (requirement-by-requirement suite). Not critical.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 1,12p tests/run.mjs | cut -c1-160; node tools/finish.mjs 2>&1 | tail -2; node tools/build.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1; timeout 590 node tests/suites/lines.mjs 2>&1 | cut -c1-240 | tail -5; grep -c '^PASS' tests/PLAN-LINES.txt; grep -n \"issues\\|critical\" ../exit-interview.json | cut -c1-200 | head -4","description":"Fix fire timing, log issues, rebuild, rerun lines suite","timeout":595000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2255,"cache_read_input_tokens":52823,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2255},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"