{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SiQQ1cB347kYRLpd2CAVss","type":"tool_result","content":"    if (this.tools.object.visible) { this.tools.mixer.update(dt); this.toolT -= dt; if (this.toolT <= 0 && this.toolName) { this.endTool(); g.events.emit('toolEnd'); } }\n    // The map rises and falls in 0.4 s.\n    const up = st.mapUp ? 1 : 0;\n    this.mapUp = clamp(this.mapUp + Math.sign(up - this.mapUp) * dt / 0.4, 0, 1);\n    const e = this.mapUp * this.mapUp * (3 - 2 * this.mapUp);\n    this.mapGroup.visible = e > 0.01; this.mapGroup.position.set(0, -0.5 * (1 - e) - this.group.position.y - (st.crouchDip ?? 0), 0.02);\n    this.mapGroup.rotation.x = -(1 - e) * 0.8 + st.fever * 0.04 * Math.sin(this.bobT * 0.4);\n    this.mapPlane.material.color?.setScalar(1);\n    this.dash.visible = !!st.dash;\n    if (st.dash) { this.dash.position.set(0, -0.0 - this.group.position.y + 0.04, 0.04); this.wheelNode.rotation.z = (st.wheel ?? 0) * 1.5; this.arrowNode.rotation.y = st.arrowYaw ?? 0; }\n  }\n80:// The wheel and dash, a separate object so it can be parented to the truck's seat.\n81:export const vmDash = model({ id: 'vm-dash', about: 'A steering wheel, a dash, a small waypoint arrow', tags: ['viewmodel'], floats: true, collider: 'none', palette: { dash: 'night', wheel: 'ink', \n83:    pivot('Wheel', [0, -0.27, 0.42], [{ torus: [0.36, 0.035, 0.36], at: [0, 0, 0], rot: [90, 0, 0], c: 'wheel' }, { box: [0.34, 0.03, 0.03], at: [0, 0, 0], c: 'wheel' }, { box: [0.03, 0.17, 0.03], \n18:**Perspective:** first person on foot, at the wheel and in story scenes, with an optional chase camera in vehicles only. The source's best ideas (a gun jamming, tablets in your palm, pliers in your own forearm, a paper map in your hands while someone shoots\n512:**Driving in first person:** eye at the driver's seat, your hands on a wheel that turns with steering, a dash, a small arrow on the dash pointing to your waypoint. R3/C toggles a chase camera (computed in your `step`, via `cam.override`). You can raise the\n716:**The mouse is native.** In menus the pointer is free (no lock), hover moves focus, click activates (read `input.buttonEvents`; convert with `x = (p.x+1)/2*hud.width`, `y = (1-p.y)/2*hud.height`). The wheel scrolls pages. Over the world it aims and looks u\n792:1. Dusk, driving a technical down the road, first person, raising the map at the wheel.\n886:- **First-person:** arms and hands (sleeve, skin); `cane`, `m38`, `flare`, `tractor`, `mule`, `empire`, `weed` with tank and hose, `tube`, bottle, charge, detonator; each gun with named rust and tape parts; syrette, tablet bottle, pliers, knife, lighter, w\n915:- Tablet to mouth, syrette, **four surgery scenes**, **raise map** and tracker, monocular, wrench on bonnet, hand on wheel and shifter, finish-it.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"cb293bbc-25b1-40a8-ad7a-9deacdd4a195","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:51:57.767Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"    if (this.tools.object.visible) { this.tools.mixer.update(dt); this.toolT -= dt; if (this.toolT <= 0 && this.toolName) { this.endTool(); g.events.emit('toolEnd'); } }\n    // The map rises and falls in 0.4 s.\n    const up = st.mapUp ? 1 : 0;\n    this.mapUp = clamp(this.mapUp + Math.sign(up - this.mapUp) * dt / 0.4, 0, 1);\n    const e = this.mapUp * this.mapUp * (3 - 2 * this.mapUp);\n    this.mapGroup.visible = e > 0.01; this.mapGroup.position.set(0, -0.5 * (1 - e) - this.group.position.y - (st.crouchDip ?? 0), 0.02);\n    this.mapGroup.rotation.x = -(1 - e) * 0.8 + st.fever * 0.04 * Math.sin(this.bobT * 0.4);\n    this.mapPlane.material.color?.setScalar(1);\n    this.dash.visible = !!st.dash;\n    if (st.dash) { this.dash.position.set(0, -0.0 - this.group.position.y + 0.04, 0.04); this.wheelNode.rotation.z = (st.wheel ?? 0) * 1.5; this.arrowNode.rotation.y = st.arrowYaw ?? 0; }\n  }\n80:// The wheel and dash, a separate object so it can be parente