{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmQJiFsWyX3yWKdYUM2W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011f3GVzDGrcAH1QKFrPAskH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Final build, after moving scenes to Timeline\nBuild 3d9ffd7203e7. M0 ride, rescue drag, M9 table scene and both endings run on the engine's Timeline (src/ui/scenes.js). `node tests/run.mjs --all`: 2338 passed, 0 failed; PLAN-LINES 306 PASS, 0 FAIL; checklist 16 PASS; 20 scenes re-shot from this build and looked at. Issues logged: 41, 17 critical.\nKnown differences from the plan: merged modules against the section 4 tree; fires tire after about 200 m; walks use the reused hero clips, not gaitClip; SpringChain, Squash and twoBoneIK unused; tracers do not use the engine's Trail (the plan allows a sprite).\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='tests/PLAN-AUDIT.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"Final build b81fac8e7b13: all suites, the plan lines (279 PASS, 0 FAIL, including measured balance bands)\",\"Final build 3d9ffd7203e7: all suites, the plan lines (306 PASS, 0 FAIL, including measured balance bands and the Timeline scenes)\").replace(\"(279 PASS, 0 FAIL on the final build)\",\"(306 PASS, 0 FAIL on the final build)\")\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+\"\\n\\nNamed in section 21's base list but not used: `gaitClip` (walks use the reused hero clips), `SpringChain`, `Squash`, `twoBoneIK`. Tracers don't use `Trail`, which section 8 allows.\\n\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80; node -e \"JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('../exit-interview.json'));console.log('json ok')\"","description":"Record the final state and recheck the hand-in"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1493,"cache_read_input_tokens":212996,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"e