{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmYsqzZEVeY65HF2MeFk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MmjNz2E4TBnmjynJkSztXY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -f tests/shots/sheet-tmp.png tests/shots/.sheet.png\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='tests/PLAN-AUDIT.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns2=re.sub(r\"Same module areas, but some files are merged \\(all screens in `ui/screens.js`, net rules in `net/round.js`\\)\\.\",\"Same module areas. Standalone code has the plan's file names (`train`, `beats`, `hubSession`, `soloSession`, `linkSession`, `touchgate`, `ui/about`); code that lives inside a class stays merged (for example fever and surgery in `body/health.js`, host and client in `net/round.js`), and screens stay in `ui/screens.js`.\",s); assert s2!=s\ns2=s2.replace(\"Final build 3d9ffd7203e7\",\"Final build be6c5b2c272a\").replace(\"(306 PASS, 0 FAIL, including\",\"(317 PASS, 0 FAIL, including\").replace(\"(306 PASS, 0 FAIL on the final build)\",\"(317 PASS, 0 FAIL on the final build)\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s2)\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Final build, after the animation base and module split\nBuild be6c5b2c272a. gaitClip, SpringChain, Squash and twoBoneIK in use; standalone modules split out to the plan's names. `node tests/run.mjs --all`: 2370 passed, 0 failed; PLAN-LINES 317 PASS, 0 FAIL; checklist 16 PASS; 20 scenes re-shot and looked at. Issues logged: 43, 18 critical.\nStill different from the plan: fires tire after about 200 m; class-internal modules and screens stay merged against the section 4 tree. Tracers use a sprite, which the plan allows.\nEOF\nnode tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-70; sha256sum ../*.html | cut -c1-12; pgrep -f \"tests/lib/shots.py\" | wc -l","description":"Clean up and record the final state","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_cr