{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmcxbEuLs3tKXtxVHxUE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**I have no more work to do on this, and I'm stopping here.** This objection doesn't point to anything in `PLAN.md` that's still undone on this computer. All that's left is what it can't do:\n\n- **Human confirmation:** nobody can give that from inside this session, and I won't write one for myself.\n- **Game feel, a real controller and listening by ear:** these need a person or hardware. Your condition only covers what can be done on this computer, and `TASK.md` says the controller and listening are never required here.\n\nI'm also keeping \"something could still be missed\" in my report. It's true: re-reading the plan's wording found the `Timeline` gap and the missing `index.html` after I'd already passed them. Dropping that sentence would make the report sound more certain without changing the game.\n\nNothing has changed since my last report, which still stands: build `2c1ef0d002d3`, 2,531 tests passed and 0 failed, and all hand-ins in `work/`. That report also has the full Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback.\n\nThe useful next step is for someone to play it, starting with `FarDrySeason-FarCry2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-162030.html`. If that or another read of the plan turns up a specific gap, I'll fix it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2778,"cache_read_input_tokens":313791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2778},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"54f849f7-d3e8-4fce-972e-8f3afa5942d7","timestamp":"2026-11-06T11:47:4