{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L1kENV7VUbeAa2WchSPbmi","type":"tool_result","content":"  m7Fight: {\n    start(g, s, st) {\n      g.warOn = true; st.target = [104, -322]; const at = siteById['the-cut'].at;\n      g.spawnSquad('concord', at[0] + 60, at[1] + 50, 6, 'm7'); g.spawnSquad('harvest', at[0] - 40, at[1] + 60, 6, 'm7'); g.spawnSquad('harvest', at[0] + 70, at[1] - 30, 4, 'm7');\n      g.world.fire.ignite(at[0] + 110, at[1] + 40, 8); g.world.fire.ignite(at[0] - 96, at[1] + 30, 8);\n      if (g.missions.altTaken) { const b = g.buddies.followers[0]; if (b) { b.duty = 'guard'; b.ctrl?.teleport([at[0] + 96, g.world.land.heightAt(at[0] + 96, at[1]) + 0.1, at[1]]); } g.world.fire.extinguishNear?.(at[0], at[1]); }\n      const tech = g.vehicles.spawn('technical', at[0] + 60, at[1] + 80, 3.1, 'm7-tech'); st.tech = tech;\nsrc/ui/prompts.js:14:  chargePreferred() { return this.game.missions.wantsCharge?.() ?? false; }\n542:If you have no syrettes, only the second option is lit. If the 40 s run out, they die anyway. If they are burning, they ask you to finish it. M6 forces this moment at least once.\n605:Contracts are taken in person (a short FP scene: the camera holds on the giver, subtitles, then Accept or Not Yet) or through the notice board in Mile Forty. After M2, the order within M3/M4 and M5/M6 is free; M5 needs M3 and M6 needs M4 (one faction's path each); M7 needs all four. Acts, for the fever's pace: act 1 is M0 to M2, act 2 is M3 to M6, act 3 is M7 onward.\n615:| M6 | The Long Field (Ansa) | 9 min, forced night | Burn the Concord's crop and its ammo bunker. Your highest-trust buddy comes along (with no buddy alive, a Harvest guide named Pell does). At about 70% the wind turns (scripted) and they go down on fire: **Syrette or Finish It** | Night fire, buddy choice | The mission itself | Scar B, 25 stones, the Ledger's first hard line |\n321:**Plants and scatter** (seeded, stored per cell for the fire):\n436:| `charge` | Remote charge | throw | carry 2 | - | 220, blast 7 m | placed | - | 3 each | Plant by holding; second press detonates |\n613:| M4 | Seed Money (Ansa) | 7 min | Payroll convoy (2 technicals, a truck) crosses the Salt Pan on a loop. Stop it, take the case. It flies out when the truck blows: you get the tracker to find it in the salt | Vehicle combat, MG, tracker | Dov: plant his charges on the bridge\n694:| Throw / plant | R1 | RB | G |\n914:- Cane knife swing, throw, plant, detonator click.\n59:      if (!p.mapUp && pressedFixed(input, 'throw')) this.throwPress();\n60-      if (this.throwHold >= 0) { // Tap to throw, hold to plant.\n61-        if (held(input, 'throw')) { this.throwHold += dt; if (this.throwHold >= 0.35) { this.throwHold = -1; if (p.charges > 0 && !p.toolBusy && !game.gunSlung()) this.plant(); } }\n62-        else { this.throwHold = -1; this.throwBottle(); }\n63-      }\n64-    }\n--\n213:  throwPress() {\n214-    const game = this.game, p = this.p;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"4be3e2cc-cbf0-46e5-9e16-0ce5b3bbfded","timestamp":"2026-11-06T11:49:00.410Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  m7Fight: {\n    start(g, s, st) {\n      g.warOn = true; st.target = [104, -322]; const at = siteById['the-cut'].at;\n      g.spawnSquad('concord', at[0] + 60, at[1] + 50, 6, 'm7'); g.spawnSquad('harvest', at[0] - 40, at[1] + 60, 6, 'm7'); g.spawnSquad('harvest', at[0] + 70, at[1] - 30, 4, 'm7');\n      g.world.fire.ignite(at[0] + 110, at[1] + 40, 8); g.world.fire.ignite(at[0] - 96, at[1] + 30, 8);\n      if (g.missions.altTaken) { const b = g.buddies.followers[0]; if (b) { b.duty = 'guard'; b.ctrl?.teleport([at[0] + 96, g.world.land.heightAt(at[0] + 96, at[1]) + 0.1, at[1]]); } g.world.fire.extinguishNear?.(at[0], at[1]); }\n      const tech = g.vehicles.spawn('technical', at[0] + 60, at[1] + 80, 3.1, 'm7-tech'); st.tech = tech;\nsrc/ui/prompts.js:14:  chargePreferred() { return this.game.mis