{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CcAJ6YvZJ4egeRi3KDKeRB","type":"tool_result","content":"verbatim lines 39 missing: 3\n  MISSING: A burning buddy:\n  MISSING: Harrow's margin notes,\n  MISSING: Load-screen epigraphs\n  ENDING MISSING: *Walk out:** *You reached the border with a case of stones and a map nobody else will ever use. The guard asks your trade.\n  ENDING MISSING: *Give it to them:** *They crossed at first light, walking on ash. Nobody has asked who lit it. The fever is not finished w\nsubtitle lines >= 60 chars: 57\n   m0.ride: 65: Forty miles of track and not one station that remembers its name.\n   m0.ride: 61: That is the Kettle. Grass to the rim, and all of it for sale.\n   m0.after: 60: You are a bad colour, friend. Sit down before you fall down.\n   m1.wake: 63: Three tablets. The fourth you pay for. I do not mean in stones.\n   m1.brief: 63: There is a rifle. It came with the last man. He stays here now.\n   m1.arrive: 61: Radio says you made it. Eleven became twelve while you drove.\n   m1.done: 64: Three tablets, as agreed. Five stones from the box, not from me.\n   m1.done: 66: The Pump Shed on the west track is empty. The last tenant is here.\n   m1.done: 63: Sleep there. Tibor wants a word. He wants a word with everyone.\n   m2.brief: 66: It fires. If you want it to fire twice, that is a different price.\n   m2.brief: 66: Ines Carvalho owes me for a truck. The Concord have her in a cage.\n   m2.brief: 65: Go at night if you are clever. Grass will hide you if you crouch.\n   m2.after: 60: You fall down out here, I will come and get you. Once a day.\n   m2.done: 63: Colonel Vance has an invoice for you. So has the schoolteacher.\nbarks per faction: concord=16 harvest=16 deserter=8 kinds spotted,lost,grenade,jammed,fire,down\nepigraphs 12 notes 6\nNOT FOUND: MG tracer ignite\nNOT FOUND: sanitize names\nNOT FOUND: pause hub only Resume Settings\nNOT FOUND: aim assist\ndone\n34:    start(g, s, st) { g.body.