{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QKwS5ecocmdT6MKXgPG1Ph","type":"tool_result","content":"6:- `play(sound: string | SoundDef, options: PlayOptions = {}): boolean`: Play a sound effect by name (built-in SFX, `register`ed or `load`ed) or directly from a SoundDef. Returns false when nothing could be heard (locked, muted, no Web Audio).\n2634:### interface Voice\n2635-\n2636-A looping sound steered while it plays (`AudioManager.loop`): a hum, a fire, a waterfall.\n2637-\n2638-- `readonly name: string`\n2639-- `readonly settings: Readonly<Required<VoiceSettings>>`: The values last set (kept headless too, so games and tests can read them).\n2640-- `readonly sounding: boolean`: Really sounding: Web Audio running and the loop started.\n2641-- `readonly stopped: boolean`\n2642-- `set(s: VoiceSettings): void`: Change any of its settings; they glide over a few hundredths of a second (no clicks).\n2643-- `stop(): void`\n2644-\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2646-\n2647-- `volume?: number`: 0..1 (default 1).\n2648-- `pan?: number`: Stereo position -1 (left) .. 1 (right).\n2649-- `muffle?: number`: 0 (clear) .. 1 (behind a thick wall, under water): a low-pass filter closing down.\n2650-- `pitch?: number`: Pitch shift in semitones.\n2651-\n2652-### type VolumeChannel\n85:    ok(26, 'balance: one rifleman at \n271:PASS §26 balance: one rifleman at 35 m takes 8 to 30 s to cost you 75 HP [14.0]\n272:PASS §26 balance: three take 4 to 15 s [6.3]\n273:PASS §26 balance: six take 2 to 8 s [6.4]\n274:FAIL §26 balance: more guns are always worse","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98060110-4ead-4574-964f-daef0a492581","uuid":"7871c45f-fda4-489d-b4a9-137fe66f9d5b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:05:08.455Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"6:- `play(sound: string | SoundDef, options: PlayOptions = {}): boolean`: Play a sound effect by name (built-in SFX, `register`ed or `load`ed) or directly from a SoundDef. Returns false when nothing could be heard (locked, muted, no Web Audio).\n2634:### interface Voice\n2635-\n2636-A looping sound steered while it plays (`AudioManager.loop`): a hum, a fire, a waterfall.\n2637-\n2638-- `readonly name: string`\n2639-- `readonly settings: Readonly<Required<VoiceSettings>>`: The values last set (kept headless too, so games and tests can read them).\n2640-- `readonly sounding: boolean`: Really sounding: Web Audio running and the loop started.\n2641-- `readonly stopped: boolean`\n2642-- `set(s: VoiceSettings): void`: Change any of its settings; they glide over a few hundredths of a second (no clicks).\n2643-- `stop(): void`\n2644-\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2646-\n2647-- `volume?: number`: 0..1 (default 1).\n2648-- `pan?: number`: Stereo position -1 (left) .. 1 (right).\n2649-- `muffle?: number`: 0 (clear) .. 1 (behind a thick wall, under water): a low-pass filter closing down.\n2650-- `pitch?: number`: Pitch shift in semitones.\n2651-\n2652-### type VolumeChannel\n85:    ok(26, 'balance: one rifleman at \n271:PASS §26 balance: one rifleman at 35 m takes 8 to 30 s to cost you 75 HP [14.0]\n272:PASS §26 balance: three take 4 to 15 s [6.3]\n273:PASS §26 balance: six take 2 to 8 s [6.4]\n274:FAIL §26 balance: more guns are always worse","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QKwS5ecocmdT6MKXgPG1Ph","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
